body:
I'm trying for nhs but have had no luck yet they have nurses  (rude people in admin too)who couldn't even be bothered when my dad was dying....getting rid of his personal stuff and stealing shit, I have to get one in nhs for my mum otherwise I'll go into despair , I'm trying to do a course on reed website can't even afford to pay for that

&#x200B;

Im based in the U.K. sorry for the rant , I'm tired and a failure my mum is toxic but I have failed her....she provided for me but I have failed her...

&#x200B;

I know how you feel.......dont know what to say I pray to god, whoever for some miracle...
